            "review_title": "Review at Kao Niew Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Yaroslav V\n4 contributions\n0\nFrom 🇷🇺 with ❤️\nFeb 2023 • Solo\nVery nice interior and pleasant restaurant in every respect, namely:\n \n1. Very friendly staff\n2. Great location\n3. Delicious beer 🍺😄\n\nAnd the most important thing for all travelers, namely for the citizens of the former Soviet Union - delicious hot food 👍\nI know we do like to eat hop dishes :)\n\nThank you all for a wonderful evening at this restaurant.\n\n Good luck and best regards!\n 🤝✊\nRead more\nWritten February 9, 2023",
